      "sizing": "At next UTC00:01 real minute open,buy maximum affordable LOT_SIZE quantity and keep residue;exit all valid units on desired cash/terminal. Existing Decimal28 PRICE/LOT/NOTIONAL/5minuteVWAP/participation execution with same1500USDT funds. No leverage,borrow,transfers,rebalancing or cash yield.",
